          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Aroni uyakubuthelwa kubantu bakubo, ngokuba akayikungena ezweni engalinika abantwana bakwa-Israyeli, ngokuba nahlubuka ezwini lami emanzini aseMeriba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.24",
